Return also "frame_scores":[{"t":"","score":0-10,"tell":"","fix":""}], "real_film_index": the mean of the frame scores ×10, "closest_ref": which REF the film is closest to and the gap in one sentence, and "top_3_upgrades".
Constraint failures: real_film_index < 60; any frame showing an obvious AI tell on a face; a UI frame that looks like a screenshot pasted on black.

